y that the real Lookkaew had cheated on him. Meanwhile, there are people trying to find out the truth.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8}],"value":8,"age":"PG-13"},"current_season_id":2282,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}